            {
              "id": "27634760-ad87-40d8-a9e3-d86d372ba53b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "7e39cbdb-1e1a-4cf5-8128-3076306cfcab",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Explores the dramatic difference between traditional media, such as books, theater, and film, and the recent development of cyberspace, which appears to shape not only how we communicate but increasingly the way we think.</em>"
